status GREEN -- hot pass 183 guards, 177 green, tree_moved=no, with fold_shelf_link_repoint and reds_ledger_headline both recovered to green by their own named repairs; standing_equipment's scan reads 63 -> 62 under ceiling and its control 4 new legs control_verdict=ok. The three remaining reds are reds_ledger_monotone and reds_row_present on peer rows the derived-spine law leaves to Keaton, and standing_equipment itself reading roster_broken on those recorded reds -- none this lap may repair, so the control asserts are proven directly rather than through the witness
